1
00:00:03,737 --> 00:00:05,537
(Leonard:)Hey, will you steam my uniform next?

2
00:00:05,739 --> 00:00:08,539
(Sheldon:)Interesting.
Do you recall this conversation?

3
00:00:08,742 --> 00:00:11,112
"Leonard, wanna go halfsies
on a steamer?"

4
00:00:11,344 --> 00:00:13,904
"No, Sheldon, we don't need a steamer."

5
00:00:15,382 --> 00:00:18,082
(Sheldon:)Looks like that rumpled
chicken's come home to roost.

6
00:00:19,085 --> 00:00:21,215
(Penny:)Hi. Here are the makeup
sponges you asked for.

7
00:00:21,421 --> 00:00:24,011
- Oh, thanks, I thought I had more.
- Hmm.

8
00:00:27,527 --> 00:00:30,357
(Penny:)Damn, you've got more makeup than I do.

9
00:00:30,563 --> 00:00:34,053
(Penny:)You've got better makeup than I do.
Yeah, I'm borrowing this.

10
00:00:34,267 --> 00:00:37,397
(Leonard:)Hey, hey, hey,
this is my Comic-Con makeup.

11
00:00:37,604 --> 00:00:41,374
(Leonard:)I love you, but there are some things
a man doesn't share with his girlfriend.

12
00:00:42,042 --> 00:00:43,742
(Sheldon:)That's a wise policy.

13
00:00:43,943 --> 00:00:46,703
(Sheldon:)I once borrowed my sister's makeup
for a costume contest...

14
00:00:46,913 --> 00:00:48,613
...got a terrible case of pink eye.

15
00:00:48,848 --> 00:00:52,248
Yeah, well, luckily, I was going
as a zombie, I won second place.

16
00:00:53,653 --> 00:00:55,283
(Penny:)You guys just went to Comic-Con.

17
00:00:55,488 --> 00:00:58,458
(Leonard:)That was San Diego Comic-Con.
This is Bakersfield Comic-Con.

18
00:00:59,259 --> 00:01:01,389
- Is that better?
- Well, it's a lot smaller.

19
00:01:01,594 --> 00:01:02,854
It's about the comic books.

20
00:01:03,063 --> 00:01:06,003
(Leonard:)The way these conventions used to be
before they went Hollywood.

21
00:01:06,232 --> 00:01:08,662
(Sheldon:)So to answer your question,
no, it's not better.

22
00:01:10,136 --> 00:01:11,296
(Penny:)Then why are you going?

23
00:01:11,871 --> 00:01:13,461
(Sheldon:)It's a comic book convention.

24
00:01:13,673 --> 00:01:15,573
(Sheldon:)Like pizza or particle accelerators...

25
00:01:15,775 --> 00:01:18,005
...even the stinky ones, still pretty good.

26
00:01:18,878 --> 00:01:21,408
(Penny:)Well, you guys have fun.
I guess I'll see you Sunday.

27
00:01:21,614 --> 00:01:23,774
- Yeah. Oh, hang on a second.
- Okay.

28
00:01:23,983 --> 00:01:25,813
(Leonard:)Hold this.

29
00:01:30,790 --> 00:01:36,020
- What was that for?
- To show people when they don't believe me.

